*.app

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ML-Agents training output (projects 08+)
**/results/
**/summaries/

# Third-party Life patterns (download them yourself, see project READMEs)
**/StreamingAssets/*.rle
